{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"怀念旧日生活与归属感，较多集中在有人陪伴、被当作自己人和亲近的关系上，容易把对整段旧生活的怀念收窄为对人际亲密与支持的怀念。\",\n    \"维持尊严主要体现为不愿重新忍受委屈、不愿仅为找回亲近而回头，主动维护尊严的行动相对集中在离开和坚持不回头，后段更多转向如何独自安顿生活。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"把维持尊严的行动改写成争取、保护珍爱生活的投入与承担，行动的核心变成不让珍贵的东西受损，而非不再以牺牲尊严换取旧日生活与归属。\",\n    \"把旧日生活与归属主要抽象成一种可以信任他人、自在亲近、不必证明自己值得被接纳的理想状态，弱化了对具体旧日生活的怀念。\",\n    \"两种力量虽然反复交织，但后半段的主要矛盾逐渐变成如何投入行动又不耗损亲近关系中的温柔，偏离了尊严维护与旧日归属怀念之间的拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X始终围绕离开后不愿再受委屈、却又怀念旧日生活和归属感这一组矛盾展开，两者反复影响彼此，基本保留了Center的核心关系。Y虽然也把行动与亲近的怀念交织起来，却将主线转成了如何争取珍爱的生活而不损耗其中的温柔。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "23c68dc0-9826-4dc2-8796-6de09f6a8c13", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075102979597Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:51:19.342267+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f1ac5be8d0b487a6908fb90f55c7ef836762624cb1c94ec2219c85b2e8adcbc8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48"